# 09_energy: cpuboss arena. The plasma gun into the floor close up (each bolt lights the floor in flight and flashes
# where it hits), then the BFG charged for a second and a half at three imps that stand still: the light at the
# muzzle grows, the ball trails green, its beams reach the imps and it goes off on the middle one.
# Run with com_enhancedEffects 0 and 1 to compare the retail effects with those of base/def, particles, materials.
map game/cpuboss
at 0 god
at 0 notarget
at 1 setviewpos -32 1850 188 90
at 2 give weapon_plasmagun
at 2 give weapon_bfg
at 2 give ammo
at 2 g_knockback 0
at 5 spawn monster_demon_imp origin "-160 2180 130" angle 270 name imp1
at 5 spawn monster_demon_imp origin "-32 2220 130" angle 270 name imp2
at 5 spawn monster_demon_imp origin "100 2180 130" angle 270 name imp3
impulse 10 8
# plasma: down at the floor ahead, then a burst swept to the left
move 50 80 pitch=40
move 90 150 yaw=40 attack
move 160 190 pitch=-40 yaw=-80
# BFG: raised, charged for a second and a half, released at the imps
impulse 200 10
move 280 370 attack
end 520
capture 0 520 every=4 fps=60
capture 100 106
capture 360 366
capture 418 440 every=2
